7,Xicotepec De Juárez Totonac – TIPs,https://tips.translation.bible/tip_language/too/,"Xicotepec De Juárez Totonac (too) is a(n) Totonacan language of Mexico, marked as shifting.Xicotepec De Juárez Totonac: “deceiver”. Eastern Highland Otomi: “you talk up above (not from the heart)”.","Totonac, Xicotepec de Juárez",Totonacan
